cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Proteoscope in your research, please cite it as below. The Methods button in the Session panel writes a methods paragraph with the references for the analyses you used."
title: "Proteoscope"
abstract: "A 3D viewer and analysis workbench for protein and nucleic-acid structures, predicted complexes, density maps and structural proteomics data. It runs locally, without installation, and keeps the user's files on their computer."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: McDermott
    given-names: Robert
repository-code: "https://github.com/robert-mcdermott/proteoscope"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.6.1
date-released: "2026-09-23"
keywords:
  - structural biology
  - protein structure
  - molecular visualization
  - structural proteomics
  - AlphaFold
  - cryo-EM
  - WebGPU
